# thefreelance.in — AI & Rule-Based System (`ai_and_rule_based_system.md`)

## Purpose

यह document developer को clear guideline देता है कि **AI कहाँ use करना है, कहाँ नहीं करना है**, और कैसे एक **low-cost hybrid system** बनाना है.

Goal:

> Minimum cost में maximum automation + acceptable quality + SEO compliance

---

# 1) Core Principle (MANDATORY)

```text
Do NOT use AI for everything
Use rules for 80% work
Use AI only where necessary (20%)
```

System design:

```text
Rule Engine (Primary) + AI Layer (Selective)
```

---

# 2) Full Content Pipeline

```text
RSS → Clean → Extract → Translate → Rewrite (Rule) → Enhance (AI Optional) → Image → Category → SEO → Verify → Publish
```

---

# 3) Where AI SHOULD NOT be used ❌

Avoid AI in:

* RSS parsing
* basic cleaning
* image fetching
* category mapping (rule-based)
* scheduling

Reason:

* unnecessary cost
* slower system

---

# 4) Where AI SHOULD be used ✅

Use AI ONLY for:

## 4.1 Headline Improvement

* better Hindi headline
* click-worthy but not clickbait

## 4.2 Summary Generation

* 2–3 line clean summary

## 4.3 Language Cleanup

* remove robotic translation
* improve readability

## 4.4 Optional Deep Rewrite (LIMITED)

* only for top stories

---

# 5) Rule-Based Rewrite Engine (CORE)

This is the main system.

## 5.1 Input

* translated text (Hindi)

## 5.2 Processing Rules

### Rule 1: Sentence Split

* long paragraph → short sentences

### Rule 2: Phrase Replacement Dictionary

Example:

```text
has announced → घोषणा की है
price cut → कीमत में कटौती
launched → लॉन्च किया
according to → के अनुसार
```

### Rule 3: Stop Words Removal

* remove filler English artifacts

### Rule 4: Structured Output Template

```text
Headline
Summary
Main Update
Details
Impact
```

---

# 6) AI Usage Strategy (Cost Control)

## Mode 1: No AI (Default)

* 80% articles
* only rule-based

## Mode 2: Light AI

* summary + headline polish

## Mode 3: Full AI (LIMITED)

* only trending / breaking news

---

# 7) AI Cost Control Rules (MANDATORY)

```text
max AI usage per day: configurable
AI only for top X articles
no AI for low priority content
```

Example:

```text
200 articles/day → only 20 AI processed
```

---

# 8) Image Engine (NO AI)

```text
keyword extraction → search API → filter → attach
```

Rules:

* no watermark
* no logo
* high resolution

---

# 9) Category Engine (RULE-BASED)

Example:

```text
iphone → tech
stock → business
cricket → sports
movie → entertainment
```

Use keyword dictionary + scoring.

---

# 10) SEO Engine (RULE + AI MIX)

## Rule-based

* slug generation
* keyword extraction

## AI (optional)

* meta description refinement

---

# 11) Quality Check Layer

Before publish:

Check:

```text
headline present
summary present
image present
category assigned
SEO fields present
```

Reject if missing.

---

# 12) Developer Restrictions (IMPORTANT)

Developer MUST NOT:

* use paid AI for all articles
* call API unnecessarily
* increase cost without approval

Developer MUST:

* log AI usage
* show cost metrics
* provide toggle for AI on/off

---

# 13) Control Panel (CMS Requirement)

Admin must control:

* AI enable/disable
* AI limit per day
* priority article flag
* rewrite mode selection

---

# 14) Final System Philosophy

```text
Cheap + Fast + Controlled
```

NOT:

```text
Expensive + Fully AI dependent
```

---

# 15) Final Summary

```text
RSS brings data
Rules process most of it
AI improves selected content
System publishes automatically
```

This ensures:

* low cost
* scalable system
* SEO-friendly output
